{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06559","headline":"同王十三维偶然作十首 六 · 储光羲","name":"同王十三维偶然作十首 六","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"黄河流向东，弱水流向西。\n趋舍各有异，造化安能齐。\n妾本邯郸女，生长在丛台。\n既闻容见宠，复想玄爲妻。\n刻画尚风流，幸会君招携。\n逶迤歌舞座，婉娈芙蓉闺。\n日月方向除，恩爱忽焉暌。\n弃置谁复道，但悲生不谐。\n羡彼匹妇意，偕老常同栖。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"储光羲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06559.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06559","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}